    <briefdescription>
<para>Type representing the thread level in CUDA thread hierarchy. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>This type can be used in hierarchy queries to specify threads as a unit of the query. There is a constexpr variable of this type available for convenience named thread. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
